<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FENCING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the world fencing championships on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Men's sabre semifinals</p>
<p>Stanislaw Pozdniakov (Russia) beat Rafal Sznajder (Poland)</p>
<p>15-10</p>
<p>Luigi Tarantino (Italy) beat Damien Touya (France)</p>
<p>15-12.</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Pozdniakov beat Tarantino 15-12</p>
<p>Men's foil semifinals</p>
<p>Kim Young-ho (South Korea) beat Wang Haibin (China)</p>
<p>15-14</p>
<p>Sergei Golubitsky (Ukraine) beat Lionel Plumenail (France) 15-9</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Golubitsky beat Kim 15-14</p>
</text>
